<title>USA: IMF welcomes Philippines' currency action.</title>
<headline>IMF welcomes Philippines' currency action.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMF Managing Director Michel Camdessus said on Thursday he welcomed action by the Philippines Central Bank to allow greater exchange rate flexibility.</p>
<p>In a statement, Camdessus also said he would recommend that the IMF board approve the Philippines' request for an extension of its Extended Fund Facility and said he would ask the board to make additional borrowing authority available.</p>
</text>
